## 2. Data Collection

**Qarbad does not collect, transmit, or share any personal or financial data you enter.**

All information you enter into this app — including but not limited to expense records, income records, account names, account balances, transaction descriptions, and any profile details (name, email, phone) — is stored **exclusively on your device** using local SQLite storage.

We do not:
- Transmit your personal or financial data to external servers
- Share your personal or financial data with third parties
- Use any analytics or tracking SDKs
- Access your location, contacts, camera, microphone, or any other device sensors
- Require an internet connection for normal operation of core features

**However**, the app integrates the **Google Mobile Ads (AdMob)** SDK to display banner advertisements. This SDK may collect certain device information as described below.

