## 4. Data Storage & Security

All personal and financial data you enter resides in a local SQLite database on your device. The app does not create any online accounts, does not sync to the cloud, and does not transmit your personal or financial data over a network.

**Data deletion:** Uninstalling Qarbad removes all stored data from your device.

## 5. Google Mobile Ads (AdMob)

Qarbad uses **Google Mobile Ads (AdMob)** to display banner advertisements. AdMob, provided by Google LLC, may collect the following information automatically:

- **Advertising ID** — a unique, user-resettable identifier provided by your device's operating system, used for advertising and user analytics
- **IP address**
- **Device type, operating system version, and screen dimensions**
- **App interactions related to ad views**

This information is collected and processed by Google in accordance with the [Google Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy).

### Opting out of interest-based ads

You can control how your Advertising ID is used at any time:
- **Android:** Settings → Google → Ads → Opt out of Ads Personalization
- **Reset your Advertising ID** in the same settings menu

When you opt out of Ads Personalization, AdMob will serve only contextual (non-personalized) ads based on general information such as the current app or time of day, rather than your interests or browsing history.

