## 7. Your Rights (GDPR, CCPA, and similar regulations)

### Regarding your financial data
All information you enter is under your control on your own device. You can edit or delete records at any time within the app, or remove all data by uninstalling the application.

### Regarding advertising data (GDPR / CCPA)
If you are in the EEA or California, you have the right to:
- **Withdraw consent** for personalized ads at any time via your device settings (Settings → Google → Ads → Opt out of Ads Personalization)
- **Request information** about what advertising data has been collected (contact us below)
- **Opt out of sale of personal information** — we do not sell your personal information

